{"id":"vod_lz_2225","vodId":"2225","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"虫师","name_cn":"虫师","date":"2005-01-01","year":"2005","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220329-1/45f7e078d3fe8bd646ebeac870a64040.jpg"},"summary":"“虫”既不是动物，也不是微生物，而是一种自然界中无处不在的力量，拥有独特的生命形态，偶尔和人类生命产生交汇，便生出一些奇妙的故事。但人们即使得知了“虫”的存在，大部分时候也不知如何应对，这便需要“虫师”出马。                                                                     　　银古就是一位虫师，他一头银发，年纪尚轻，但已经半生游历，经过一个个山野、村庄，为人们解决“虫”的问题，通过和被“虫”困扰的人们接近，他也接近了许多故事。银古的游历像风一样，再惊心动魄的“虫”似乎都融化在水墨样的山峦叠嶂间，芸芸众生也是过眼云烟，淡淡的故事里没有哀伤只有静穆。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-03-29 15:07:58","playable":true,"episodeCount":26,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2082_b881f557/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2084_1753e020/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2083_d4d75323/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2085_f0576d47/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2086_c0ccb8c9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2087_c38fb2b5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2088_d5e0b9e7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2089_eadcc742/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2090_9894a6b3/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2091_92c4228b/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2092_8559a05f/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2093_32159a42/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2094_e8731e74/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220329/2095_6ce7fd08/index.m3u8"},{"name"